<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-GUD buys car filter businesses.</title>
<headline>RTRS-GUD buys car filter businesses.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversified manufacturer GUD Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it had bought automotive filter manufacturers Wesfil Australia Pty Ltd and Wesfil Filters Pty Ltd for an undisclosed price.  </p>
<p>GUD managing director Ian Beynon said the Wesfil businesses were an important strategic fit with GUD's filtrations products operations.</p>
<p>Wesfil Australia is Perth-based while Wesfil Filters is Sydney based.</p>
<p>They have combined annual sales of about A$8 million.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
